+// AdvancedDisplay is a LineageOS-only app (depends on org.lineageos.platform.internal
+// / settings.resources, which do not exist in a PixelExperience tree). It is unused
+// by gta4l — only keymaster is needed from hardware/samsung — so the module is
+// disabled here to let soong bootstrap succeed. Restore with `git checkout` if a
+// LineageOS build ever needs it.
